    "Scan of the 1969 edition of the Bradford, Pennsylvania, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1969; photo inspected in 1983; photo revised in 1981; last revised in 1981; printed in 1991.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.9 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
